      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bff3a95afb6afff0",
      "translationZh": "SSD Samsung 970EVO 1tb - 本来就有",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f2ea636825a4362",
      "translationZh": "这种机器的功耗当然也不是闹着玩的：",
